lengthTest is test
lengthTest purpose "wcslen and wcsnlen count to the 0, wcscpy, wcsncpy, wcscat, wcsncat, wcsdup, and the wmem functions copy, pad, and move as glibc's do"
lengthTest verifies wcscpy copiesWide
lengthTest verifies wcsncpy padsWithZeros
lengthTest typeParameter none
