stringConversionTest is test
stringConversionTest purpose "mbstowcs, wcstombs, mbsrtowcs, and wcsrtombs convert whole strings and as many as fit, count with no target, and stop at a wide character above 255; uchar.h's functions give the same as wchar.h's"
stringConversionTest verifies mbstowcs convertsToWide
stringConversionTest verifies wcstombs convertsToBytes
stringConversionTest typeParameter none
stringConversionTest input none
stringConversionTest output none
stringConversionTest outputOwnedBy none
stringConversionTest raises none
stringConversionTest effect use machine.memory
stringConversionTest effect use system.calls
stringConversionTest uses memoryAccess
stringConversionTest uses systemCalls
stringConversionTest memoryHeap false
stringConversionTest async false
stringConversionTest maxRecursion none
stringConversionTest label begin loopKind none
stringConversionTest label begin within none
stringConversionTest let eight Int64 8 immutable
stringConversionTest let text1 String "hello" immutable
stringConversionTest let text2 String "" immutable
